This project focuses on Customer Behaviour Analysis using a combination of Python, SQL, and Power BI to uncover actionable insights from transactional and demographic data. SQL was used to clean, filter, and extract meaningful subsets of customer information from the database. Python performed deeper analysis, including data preprocessing, feature engineering, frequency and recency calculations, and visual exploration to identify customer purchasing patterns. Finally, Power BI was used to build an interactive dashboard that highlights key trends such as customer segments, purchase frequency, product preferences, and overall customer lifetime value. This end-to-end workflow provides a comprehensive understanding of customer behaviour to support better decision-making and targeted business strategies.
